    "Matching is longest-phrase-first on word boundaries, so a multi-word entry",
    "like 'chest pain' wins over a shorter overlapping one. Keep entries",
    "lowercase; the extractor normalises input before matching.",
    "",
    "Every key must exist in the trained model's vocabulary. A test enforces",
    "this: an unknown key is a typo that would silently never match."
